\\section\{Dataset: Wharton Research Data Services\}\
\
The panel dataset used for this paper comes from three primary datasets included with the Columbia University license of Wharton Research Data Services (WRDS): Compustat (North America), Boardex, and the Center for Research in Securities Pricing (CRSP). Queries from these three datasets, alongside additional data coding operations executed in python, are used to construct the final panel dataset of observations from January of 2015 to December of 2025. The only non-WRDS data included in the analysis is taken from the world bank (11 observations for annual U.S. GDP growth from 2015-2025).\
