\
\\textit\{Appendix A: Overview of Data Construction Pipeline\} is included in the Appendix section to provide a more comprehensive overview of the explicit steps followed when querying and modifying all WRDS data collections. Additionally, each of the following sub-sections will reference subsequent Appendix entries that capture the specific query parameters used to collect the resulting data.\
